  "as_of_notes": "Figures are 'All' voter-status totals (Active + Inactive + Provisional) per county from the official Montana SOS 'Registered Voters By County' live Tableau dashboard (tableau-ext.mt.gov view RegisteredVotersByCounty/RegVoterCounty), which reflects the statewide voter registration system. The dashboard does not publish a fixed snapshot label; data were retrieved live on 2026-06-14. The hosting SOS web page was last content-modified 2026-04-28.",
  "data_quality": "high",
  "notes": "All 56 Montana counties present. Sum of county 'All'-status totals (791,434) equals the dashboard's statewide 'All' total (791,434) exactly. Montana does not register voters by party, so registers_by_party=false and all by_party fields are null. Per-county totals retrieved via the SOS Tableau dashboard's official CSV data export. Status breakdown available in source: Active/Inactive/Provisional; this file uses the combined 'All' total registered per county."
